# Lane w-splice — what must never be committed.
#
# CLAUDE.md: no build artifacts, no captured IL, no large binaries. The scan
# JSONLs are ~60 MB each and every table in the rung regenerates from a scan;
# the objs are `cl.exe` output. `caps/*.excerpt.txt` IS committed — it is the
# hand verification and the per-symbol relocation evidence quoted in the rung,
# and it is a few dozen lines.
*.jsonl
*.obj
caps/*.text.txt
